Subject: [PATCH 02187/11362] [outer-loop] ARC solve LEARNING loop: cross-game
 transfer routing (success->speed)

recommend_approach(game) routes a new game to the closest SOLVED game's proven
recipe by survey-feature similarity (validated: vc33->lp85/r11l click recipes;
tu93->wa30/ls20 keyboard recipes). New games start from prior learning, not zero.
CLAUDE.md discipline now mandates calling it first + recording dead-ends
(learn-from-failures). Deeper search-acceleration (verifier-pruner) is the
north-star next loop.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
